{"id":"3d4df5998d1c3fc1","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-model10-ordinal-height-of-model.md","title":"ZFC Model10 Ordinal Height Of Model","display":"df-zfc-model10-ordinal-height-of-model — ZFC Model10 Ordinal Height Of Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model10-ordinal-height-of-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model10-ordinal-height-of-model"],"display":"df-zfc-model10-ordinal-height-of-model — ZFC Model10 Ordinal Height Of Model","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model10-ordinal-height-of-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model10-ordinal-height-of-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model10-ordinal-height-of-model — ZFC Model10 Ordinal Height Of Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span> (set-coded carrier whose external ordinal height is measured)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> (ordinal height, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10OrdinalHeightOfModel}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10OrdinalHeightOfModel}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}height\\text{-}of\\text{-}model}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10OrdinalHeightOfModel}_S(\\theta,M)\\leftrightarrow M\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\theta=\\bigcup\\{\\alpha\\in M:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}height\\text{-}of\\text{-}model}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10OrdinalHeightOfModel}_S(\\theta,M)\\leftrightarrow M\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\theta=\\bigcup\\{\\alpha\\in M:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the external ordinal height of a set-coded carrier. If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is transitive, the set under the supremum is exactly <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\cap\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(M\\cap\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","loc